WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.169 --> 00:00:03.290
Welcome to the Sequencer Introduction

2
00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:04.889
for Game Development.

3
00:00:04.889 --> 00:00:07.129
In this class, we'll briefly discuss game development

4
00:00:07.129 --> 00:00:10.169
and how it relates to using Sequencer for game development.

5
00:00:10.169 --> 00:00:12.169
We'll run through core concepts of Sequencer

6
00:00:12.169 --> 00:00:14.970
and the features and tools available through Sequencer.

7
00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:18.410
We'll build an in-game cut scene sequence from scratch.

8
00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:20.570
And finally, run through a few recommendations

9
00:00:20.570 --> 00:00:22.690
on organizing your workflow and layouts

10
00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:24.489
when using Sequencer.

11
00:00:24.489 --> 00:00:26.829
All of the files that you'll need for today's class

12
00:00:26.829 --> 00:00:30.089
are going to be located in your content, courses,

13
00:00:30.089 --> 00:00:32.549
SEQ10500.

14
00:00:32.549 --> 00:00:34.450
And in the Maps folder, you'll find the map

15
00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:36.289
that we're using for today's class.

16
00:00:36.289 --> 00:00:38.210
So let's get started.
